# =============================================================================
#  profile/packages.x86_64 — packages installed into the Aegis OS image
# =============================================================================
#  Lines starting with # are ignored. Every listed package MUST exist in a
#  configured repo at build time or mkarchiso fails. High-confidence core/extra
#  names are always on; a curated set of stable BlackArch tools lives in the
#  guarded block near the bottom (stripped when AEGIS_ENABLE_BLACKARCH=0).
#
#  How much of the 2800+ BlackArch arsenal is baked in is controlled by
#  AEGIS_TOOL_SET in aegis.conf: `broad` (default) makes build-iso.sh APPEND the
#  major category groups (AEGIS_BLACKARCH_GROUPS) here at staging time; `full`
#  appends the whole `blackarch` group; `lean` appends nothing. Anything not
#  baked in is always installable post-boot via `aegis-tools`.
# =============================================================================

