# --- Networking --------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTE: no dhcpcd here, on purpose. Its package post-install enables
# dhcpcd.service, which then races NetworkManager for every interface at
# boot: two DHCP clients on one link = slow/flaky networking on the live
# ISO. NetworkManager ships its own internal DHCP client, so nothing is lost.
networkmanager
network-manager-applet
networkmanager-openvpn
networkmanager-openconnect
nm-connection-editor
iwd
wpa_supplicant
wireless-regdb
iw
dnsmasq
openvpn
openconnect
wireguard-tools
modemmanager
mobile-broadband-provider-info
usb_modeswitch
ethtool
iproute2
net-tools
bridge-utils
macchanger
tor
torsocks
proxychains-ng
# Extra networking layers a security OS should not boot without:
#   nftables  - firewall framework
#   traceroute / mtr - path diagnostics (parity with Kali)
nftables
traceroute
mtr

