# Whisker Menu is the panel's "Aegis" menu button (see etc/skel/.config/xfce4/
# xfconf/xfce-perchannel-xml/xfce4-panel.xml). It already arrives via the
# xfce4-goodies group; pinned explicitly so the panel can never reference a
